      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.62,
      "end_seconds": 24.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "probably two weeks. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.92,
      "end_seconds": 30.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.16,
      "end_seconds": 58.99,
      "duration_seconds": 26.83,
      "text": "Lying flat definitely sets it off. Only sitting forward, and it's not much. It happens on and off. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. Oh, and chest pain. That's been about the same, ten days. As for chest pain, mild, really. It happens on and off. I get some relief from sitting forward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.43,
      "end_seconds": 62.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any cough or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.1,
      "end_seconds": 68.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "No cough or leg swelling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.45,
      "end_seconds": 72.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Okay, how about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.2,
      "end_seconds": 77.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "no, you know, I haven't had any fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.07,
      "end_seconds": 84.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.21,
      "end_seconds": 86.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.54,
      "end_seconds": 92.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.0,
      "end_seconds": 96.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.58,
      "end_seconds": 101.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.3,
      "end_seconds": 104.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.61,
      "end_seconds": 114.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.82,
      "end_seconds": 123.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "I had a reaction to tramadol when I was younger, vomiting, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.15,
      "end_seconds": 141.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.14,
      "end_seconds": 145.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.78,
      "end_seconds": 150.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.53,
      "end_seconds": 157.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.03,
      "end_seconds": 160.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Alright, how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.76,
      "end_seconds": 164.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.23,
      "end_seconds": 169.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.98,
      "end_seconds": 174.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.86,
      "end_seconds": 185.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.1,
      "end_seconds": 201.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.5,
      "end_seconds": 221.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 96 beats a minute, respiratory rate 17, saturation 99 percent, pressure 94 over 62."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.22,
      "end_seconds": 228.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "So, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.22,
      "end_seconds": 246.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "yes, that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.88,
      "end_seconds": 250.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Your neck veins are swollen, the heart sounds are muffled and your blood pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.37,
      "end_seconds": 272.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.71,
      "end_seconds": 317.68,
      "duration_seconds": 30.97,
      "text": "taking everything into account, this looks most like possible cardiac tamponade. Let's book an ECG to look into chest pain. Let's book an urgent echocardiogram to look into possible tamponade. You need an urgent heart scan and possibly a drain. I'm going to send a referral to the cardiology team. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.4,
      "end_seconds": 321.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.91,
      "end_seconds": 329.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "I'll want another look straight away. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.76,
      "end_seconds": 335.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.99,
      "end_seconds": 340.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.51,
      "end_seconds": 344.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
